{"t":"UHS","n":"Universal Health Services, Inc.","nKo":"유니버설 헬스 서비스","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":183.33,"chg":3.9,"chgPct":0.02174,"prev":179.43,"dayH":184.44,"dayL":178.21,"w52H":246.33,"w52L":140.08,"vol":509098,"avgVol":633990,"mcap":10569362432,"pe":7.67,"fpe":8.02,"eps":23.89,"feps":22.85,"pb":1.39,"div":0.8,"divY":0.0044,"beta":1.11,"short":2548231,"shortPct":0.0617,"shortRatio":4.07,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Medical Care Facilities","iKo":"의료시설","city":"King of Prussia","emp":102000,"web":"https://uhs.com","sum":"Universal Health Services, Inc., through its subsidiaries, owns and operates acute care hospitals, and outpatient and behavioral health care facilities in the United States. It operates through Acute Care Hospital Services and Behavioral Health Care Services segments. The company's hospitals offer general and specialty surgery, internal medicine, obstetrics, emergency room care, radiology, oncology, diagnostic and coronary care, pediatric, pharmacy, and/or behavioral health services. It also provides commercial health insurance services; capital resources; and various management services, including central purchasing, information services, finance and control systems, facilities planning, physician recruitment, administrative personnel management, marketing, and public relations services. ","sumKo":"Universal Health Services, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 급성 치료 병원, 외래 환자 및 행동 건강 관리 시설을 소유하고 운영합니다. 급성 치료 병원 서비스 및 행동 건강 관리 서비스 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 회사의 병원은 일반 및 전문 외과, 내과, 산부인과, 응급실 진료, 방사선과, 종양학, 진단 및 관상동맥 진료, 소아과, 약국 및/또는 행동 건강 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 상업용 건강 보험 서비스도 제공합니다. 자본자원; 중앙 구매, 정보 서비스, 재무 및 제어 시스템, 시설 계획, 의사 채용, 행정 인력 관리, 마케팅 및 홍보 서비스를 포함한 다양한 관리 서비스."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":13399370000,"ni":675609000},{"y":2023,"rev":14281976000,"ni":717795000},{"y":2024,"rev":15827935000,"ni":1142097000},{"y":2025,"rev":17364829000,"ni":1488796000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":4486048000,"ni":445941000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev